 "relevance": {
  "output": {
   "relevant": true,
   "layer": "regulation",
   "reason": "The letter sets the 2023 maximum monthly wage used as the base for Jaminan Pensiun contributions at Rp9.559.600, starting March 2023. The employee's 1% JP contribution is a deductible pension contribution in the PPh 21 calculation for permanent employees. Changing the wage cap therefore changes the deduction amount for employees earning above the cap. The adjustment uses the PP 45/2015 formula (previous cap × (1 + 2022 GDP growth)) and is a new value, not a restatement. No end date is stated; the cap applies until the next annual adjustment.",
   "quotes": [
    {
     "provision": "angka 4",
     "quote": "Batas paling tinggi Upah sebagai dasar perhitungan iuran Jaminan Pensiun mulai bulan\nMaret 2023"
